<title>SINGAPORE: Informatics 1st-half net up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Informatics 1st-half net up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 3.86  vs  3.29</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 0.15  vs  0.10</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cents)   1.29  vs  1.10</p>
<p>    Turnover			  37.35  vs 33.82</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 8.30  vs  7.07</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation    2.82  vs  2.51</p>
<p>    Loss from associates	   0.24  vs  0.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   5.16  vs  4.43</p>
<p>    Tax				  1.24  vs  0.98</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		0.05  vs  0.16</p>
<p>Note - Informatics Holdings Ltd offers information technology training. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
